              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa ungabayekeli, ngoba kubo bamqamekele amadoda angaphezu kwamatshumi amane, azibophe ngesifungo ukuthi kabayikudla lokunatha aze ambulale; kalokhu aselungile, akhangele. Ngesithembiso esivela kuwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.21",
