              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khona induna yenkulungwane yayisiyiyeke insizwa, yayiyala ngokuthi: “Bheka, ungatsheli muntu ukuthi ungibikele lokho.",
          "type": "text",
